    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cartier has just unveiled its latest handbag design: the Clash de Cartier. Drawing inspiration from the brand's Clash de Cartier jewelry collection and the silhouette of an envelope, the new piece features a clean, minimalist tote construction accented by a rotating stud closure, exuding an air of elegant sophistication.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/l606ntd/0d2e2375bcf4d91f.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/l606ntd/ba3f1fc2024a3705.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Clash de Cartier bag is defined by its rotating stud closure, carrying forward the house's jewelry design DNA. A gold-plated cone-shaped stud clasp sits on either side of the opening. The bag can be left open for a relaxed, effortless look, or easily fastened via the stud clasps for a more polished, structured style.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
