    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The body is crafted from soft, refined calfskin with a lambskin lining, meticulously made in Cartier's Florence atelier. The natural leather grain develops a warm patina over time, subtly enhancing the gold-stamped Cartier logo and the gleaming jewelry-inspired stud clasps. The distinctive stud closure system adds a striking finishing touch to the sleek silhouette.",
